• the recipient’s saving, forwarding or use of files;
• failures, restrictions or data processing of third-party products or services such as network operators, routers, operating systems, cloud drives and backups;
• force majeure and events beyond our reasonable control, such as power outages or device damage.

Please back up important files yourself. We are not liable for data loss caused by a lack of backup, except where it results from our fault.

This section does not exclude or limit liability for intent, gross negligence, personal injury or any other liability that by law cannot be excluded or limited, nor does it affect the rights granted to you by applicable consumer-protection law.
